ACADEMY PERF academy-course 1920x1080 p50_ms=16.58 p95_ms=26.92 max_ms=135.80 frames=600 nodes=5253 draw_calls=224 primitives=8202
ACADEMY PERF town-return 1920x1080 p50_ms=16.72 p95_ms=26.79 max_ms=34.23 frames=300 nodes=4915 draw_calls=2141 primitives=43822

